  "body": "Positioned on a generous 585sqm (approx.) section, this substantial 323.8sqm (approx.) residence has been thoughtfully crafted to deliver exceptional space, flexibility, and contemporary comfort for modern family living. Designed across two expansive levels, this impressive home is perfectly suited for large or multi-generational families seeking privacy, functionality, and effortless entertaining. Complete with a 10-Year Master Build Guarantee, it offers peace of mind and quality assurance for years to come.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, the ground floor showcases a light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area designed to bring families together. A stylish feature fireplace creates a warm and inviting atmosphere, enhancing the comfort and charm of the main living space.\r\nThe designer kitchen combines style with practicality, featuring premium appliances, an integrated downdraft cooktop, generous bench space, and a sophisticated wine cabinet - perfect for those who love cooking and entertaining. The kitchen is also equipped with a high-end built-in refrigerator, featuring a seamless integrated design that combines aesthetics and functionality, showcasing a modern lifestyle of quality and sophistication. Enhancing versatility, a fully equipped scullery sits alongside the main kitchen, ideal for larger households, hosting guests, or preparing elaborate family meals with ease. Seamlessly extending from the living and dining area, large sliding doors open onto an expansive kwila deck, creating effortless indoor-outdoor flow and offering the perfect setting to relax, entertain, and enjoy stunning sea views.\r\nAdding further appeal, the ground floor offers excellent granny potential with its own cozy living area, two well-proportioned bedrooms, and a beautifully appointed bathroom - an ideal setup for extended family, teenagers, guests, or semi-independent living.\r\nUpstairs, an additional living area offers a peaceful retreat, perfect as a media room, formal lounge, or quiet family space away from the main living hub. This area enjoys beautiful sea views, creating a relaxing and light-filled space for everyday living and entertaining.\r\n\r\nAccommodation on the upper level has been thoughtfully configured for both comfort and privacy. The spacious master suite features a walk-in wardrobe and elegant ensuite, while another bedroom also enjoys its own private ensuite - ideal for guests or older family members. Two additional generously sized bedrooms are serviced by a beautifully finished shared family bathroom, ensuring ample space for the entire household.\r\nAdditional Features Include:\r\nCentral air-conditioning\r\nHeat pump in granny potential\r\nIntercom\r\nPre-wired EV charger\r\nDouble internal-access garage\r\nA separate laundry provides additional convenience for busy family life\r\n\r\nPositioned in one of Millwater's most desirable locations, this property provides easy access to top-rated schools, lush parks, golden beaches, boutique shopping, and convenient transport links. It's a lifestyle address designed for families who value quality, space, and connection.\r\n\r\nA rare opportunity to secure a spacious and adaptable family home designed to meet the evolving needs of modern living.\r\nContact Team Sabrina today to arrange your private viewing or visit the next open home.",
